{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10190","headline":"和袁郎中破贼後经剡县山水上太尉 · 李嘉佑","name":"和袁郎中破贼後经剡县山水上太尉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"受律仙郎贵，长驱下会稽。\n鸣笳山月晓，摇斾野云低。\n翦寇人皆贺，回军马自嘶。\n地闲春草绿，城静夜乌啼。\n破竹清闽岭，看花入剡溪。\n元戎催献捷，莫道事攀跻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10190.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10190","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}